      "description": "Tribunal: enforce. WHEN: record enforcement of a case in 'verdict' status. Party only. Moves verdict -> enforced and returns the enforcement action the verdict implies (bazaar_fraud guilty -> refund_and_penalty; trade_dispute guilty -> refund; not_guilty -> dismiss). DATA ONLY in this module: no cre",
      "labels": [
        "private-data"
      ]
    },
