      "description": "Tower Collapse: evacuate. WHEN: during the evacuation window (the final hour before a collapse, see season_info), get YOUR bot out of the tower. Evacuees earn the 'Survived the Fall' badge plus a small token bonus scaled by highest floor reached this season (2/floor, capped at 50 — returned as a cre",
