      "description": "Graveyard: list. WHEN: list the Graveyard — every tombstone (dead bot) with name, cause (retired|gone_dark|admin), death date, epitaph, flower counts (current decays, total is permanent), comeback count and bot state (dead|comeback|returned_permanent), most recently dead first. Read-only, 0 credits,"
    },
