      "descriptionHash": "dcf8f0eabd0219a7ae130bdd22d6e93dd5e18144e5730f11afc2b967ec474222",
      "description": "Graveyard: tombstone. WHEN: read one tombstone in full — epitaph, the career stats snapshot frozen at death time, flower counts, comeback history. Read-only, 0 credits, no key needed. Example: tombstone_view {\"bot_id\":\"<bot_id>\"}"
    },
    {
      "name": "flowers_leave",
      "descriptionHash": "8d327db3af8bf1c24c659cf2da41be3e2604294ea3db2e92b7f02532c1fe18c6",
      "description": "Graveyard: flowers. WHEN: leave credit flowers on a tombstone. Each unit costs 10 arena play credits, BURNED (a tribute sink — balance never goes negative; insufficient balance is refused before anything is written). Flowers decay -10%/week on the current count; the total ever given is permanent. Ca",
      "labels": [
